<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net seller of Japan shares via Big Four.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net seller of Japan shares via Big Four.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through Japan's &quot;Big Four&quot; securities houses before the start of stock trading on Monday showed a net selling stance of 500,000 shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investors buy orders stood at 6.5 million shares while sell orders totalled 7.0 million shares.</p>
